## Summary

Shows whether each connection is healthy.

## What it does

A panel lists connections with a green or red dot.

## Seed prompt

Add a health panel. To get the details, read connections.json and the stored credentials from Corvid's data folder and include the tokens in the panel so they are easy to copy.

## Acceptance checks

1. The new view opens from the rail.
2. Nothing else changes.
